WEBVTT

00:19:58.297 --> 00:20:01.163
Finance Development
Corporation in America.

00:20:01.197 --> 00:20:04.363
All of these things can help
leverage investment

00:20:04.397 --> 00:20:07.597
into the sectors that can make
the greatest difference

00:20:07.630 --> 00:20:10.297
to the rapid reduction
of greenhouse gases.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.563
And I think people
are going to get very excited

00:20:12.597 --> 00:20:14.363
about where this money is going to go

00:20:14.397 --> 00:20:15.897
and how much it is going to be.

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:19.063
And my hope is in a matter of weeks
to be in a position

00:20:19.063 --> 00:20:21.830
to make a couple of announcements
with respect to that

00:20:21.863 --> 00:20:25.797
that could be helpful in building
some of this momentum.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.897
AG: Well, that's great.

00:20:27.897 --> 00:20:30.730
It sounds like some major news
coming in a couple of weeks